cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Adaptive Superdense Coding with Outage-Resilient Key Pools for Secure One-to-One and One-to-Many Quantum Communication"
abstract: "Simulation code for a study of entanglement-based key distribution and superdense coding on the same verified pairs: a density-matrix model of both modes, a fibre link model, telemetry-based attack detection, multi-hop and one-to-many delivery with key pools, a hybrid protocol, and a design-space sweep."
